# agent skills
# Canonical skill content lives in .agents/skills and IS committed, along with
# skills-lock.json. Everything below is a per-tool mirror of it that the skills
# CLI regenerates -- on Windows these are links that git would otherwise commit
# as a second, divergent copy. Restore them with:
#   npx skills experimental_install
.claude/skills/
